Avast\u0026nbsp;SecureLine\u0026nbsp;VPN:\u0026nbsp;تصفح\u0026nbsp;الإنترنت\u0026nbsp;بأمان\u0026nbsp;تام\u0026nbsp;وخصوصية\u0026nbsp;مطلقة\u0026nbsp;مع\u0026nbsp;شبكة\u0026nbsp;افتراضية\u0026nbsp;خاصة\u0026nbsp;(VPN)\u0026nbsp;عالية\u0026nbsp;السرعة.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvast\u0026nbsp;Cleanup\u0026nbsp;Premium:\u0026nbsp;حسّن\u0026nbsp;أداء\u0026nbsp;جهازك\u0026nbsp;عبر\u0026nbsp;تنظيف\u0026nbsp;الملفات\u0026nbsp;غير\u0026nbsp;الضرورية\u0026nbsp;وتحسين\u0026nbsp;إعدادات\u0026nbsp;النظام،\u0026nbsp;لضمان\u0026nbsp;عمله\u0026nbsp;بسلاسة\u0026nbsp;وسرعة.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvast\u0026nbsp;AntiTrack:\u0026nbsp;احمِ\u0026nbsp;خصوصيتك\u0026nbsp;على\u0026nbsp;الإنترنت\u0026nbsp;عن\u0026nbsp;طريق\u0026nbsp;منع\u0026nbsp;تتبع\u0026nbsp;نشاطاتك\u0026nbsp;من\u0026nbsp;قبل\u0026nbsp;المعلنين\u0026nbsp;والجهات\u0026nbsp;الأخرى.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eتفاصيل\u0026nbsp;الاشتراك:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eعدد\u0026nbsp;الأجهزة:\u0026nbsp;جهاز\u0026nbsp;واحد.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eمدة\u0026nbsp;الاشتراك:\u0026nbsp;سنة\u0026nbsp;واحدة.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eالترخيص:\u0026nbsp;مفتاح\u0026nbsp;تفعيل\u0026nbsp;أصلي.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eالتفعيل:\u0026nbsp;فوري\u0026nbsp;بعد\u0026nbsp;الشراء.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eالدعم:\u0026nbsp;متوفر\u0026nbsp;على\u0026nbsp;مدار\u0026nbsp;الساعة.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"dc:T436,Avast Ultimate Subscription: Ultimate Protection for Your Device and Performance\n\nAvast Ultimate is the all-in-one solution to secure and optimize your device. This subscription combines four professional tools to provide comprehensive protection against all cyber threats, while ensuring the highest levels of privacy and speed.\n\nWhat Does the Avast Ultimate Subscription Includes?\n\nAvast Premium Security: Powerful and immediate protection against viruses, malware, phishing sites, and cyberattacks.\n\nAvast SecureLine VPN: Browse the internet with complete security and privacy using a high-speed VPN.\n\nAvast Cleanup Premium: Optimize your device's performance by cleaning unnecessary files and optimizing system settings to ensure smooth and fast operation.\n\nAvast AntiTrack: Protect your online privacy by preventing advertisers and other third parties from tracking your online activity.\n\nSubscription Details:\n\nNumber of Devices: One device.\n\nSubscription Duration: One year.\n\nLicense: Genuine activation key.\n\nActivation: Instant after purchase.\n\nSupport: Available 24/7.dd:T951,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003eBitdefender\u0026nbsp;Total\u0026nbsp;Security\u0026nbsp;Subscription:\u0026nbsp;Comprehensive\u0026nbsp;Protection\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;Your\u0026nbsp;Device\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBitdefender\u0026nbsp;Total\u0026nbsp;Security\u0026nbsp;is\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;ideal\u0026nbsp;solution\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;complete\u0026nbsp;protection\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;device\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;data.\u0026nbsp;This\u0026nbsp;subscription\u0026nbsp;combines\u0026nbsp;a\u0026nbsp;suite\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;powerful\u0026nbsp;tools\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;antivirus,\u0026nbsp;privacy\u0026nbsp;protection,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;performance\u0026nbsp;optimization,\u0026nbsp;ensuring\u0026nbsp;a\u0026nbsp;safe\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;seamless\u0026nbsp;digital\u0026nbsp;experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBitdefender\u0026nbsp;Total\u0026nbsp;Security\u0026nbsp;Subscription\u0026nbsp;Features:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eComprehensive\u0026nbsp;Virus\u0026nbsp;Protection:\u0026nbsp;Provides\u0026nbsp;robust\u0026nbsp;protection\u0026nbsp;against\u0026nbsp;all\u0026nbsp;types\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;viruses,\u0026nbsp;malware,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;ransomware.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdvanced\u0026nbsp;Firewall:\u0026nbsp;Effectively\u0026nbsp;protects\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;device\u0026nbsp;from\u0026nbsp;cyberattacks\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;intrusions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFinancial\u0026nbsp;Transaction\u0026nbsp;Protection:\u0026nbsp;Provides\u0026nbsp;a\u0026nbsp;secure\u0026nbsp;environment\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;online\u0026nbsp;shopping\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;banking.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnti-Theft\u0026nbsp;Tools:\u0026nbsp;Helps\u0026nbsp;locate\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;lost\u0026nbsp;device\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;protect\u0026nbsp;it\u0026nbsp;from\u0026nbsp;theft.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt-in\u0026nbsp;VPN:\u0026nbsp;Browse\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;internet\u0026nbsp;securely\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;privately\u0026nbsp;with\u0026nbsp;a\u0026nbsp;built-in\u0026nbsp;Virtual\u0026nbsp;Private\u0026nbsp;Network\u0026nbsp;(VPN).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDevice\u0026nbsp;Performance\u0026nbsp;Optimization:\u0026nbsp;Includes\u0026nbsp;built-in\u0026nbsp;tools\u0026nbsp;to\u0026nbsp;optimize\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;system\u0026#39;s\u0026nbsp;performance\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;clean\u0026nbsp;up\u0026nbsp;unnecessary\u0026nbsp;files.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eParental\u0026nbsp;Controls:\u0026nbsp;Provides\u0026nbsp;effective\u0026nbsp;tools\u0026nbsp;to\u0026nbsp;protect\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;children\u0026nbsp;from\u0026nbsp;harmful\u0026nbsp;online\u0026nbsp;content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdditional\u0026nbsp;Information:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNumber\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;Devices:\u0026nbsp;Available\u0026nbsp;in\u0026nbsp;multiple\u0026nbsp;packages\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;1,\u0026nbsp;3,\u0026nbsp;or\u0026nbsp;5\u0026nbsp;devices,\u0026nbsp;depending\u0026nbsp;on\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;needs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eActivation:\u0026nbsp;Activation\u0026nbsp;is\u0026nbsp;done\u0026nbsp;via\u0026nbsp;a\u0026nbsp;genuine\u0026nbsp;key\u0026nbsp;after\u0026nbsp;installing\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;program.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRenewal:\u0026nbsp;The\u0026nbsp;subscription\u0026nbsp;can\u0026nbsp;be\u0026nbsp;easily\u0026nbsp;renewed\u0026nbsp;upon\u0026nbsp;expiry.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"de:T951,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003eBitdefender\u0026nbsp;Total\u0026nbsp;Security\u0026nbsp;Subscription:\u0026nbsp;Comprehensive\u0026nbsp;Protection\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;Your\u0026nbsp;Device\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBitdefender\u0026nbsp;Total\u0026nbsp;Security\u0026nbsp;is\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;ideal\u0026nbsp;solution\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;complete\u0026nbsp;protection\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;device\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;data.\u0026nbsp;This\u0026nbsp;subscription\u0026nbsp;combines\u0026nbsp;a\u0026nbsp;suite\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;powerful\u0026nbsp;tools\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;antivirus,\u0026nbsp;privacy\u0026nbsp;protection,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;performance\u0026nbsp;optimization,\u0026nbsp;ensuring\u0026nbsp;a\u0026nbsp;safe\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;seamless\u0026nbsp;digital\u0026nbsp;experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBitdefender\u0026nbsp;Total\u0026nbsp;Security\u0026nbsp;Subscription\u0026nbsp;Features:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eComprehensive\u0026nbsp;Virus\u0026nbsp;Protection:\u0026nbsp;Provides\u0026nbsp;robust\u0026nbsp;protection\u0026nbsp;against\u0026nbsp;all\u0026nbsp;types\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;viruses,\u0026nbsp;malware,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;ransomware.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdvanced\u0026nbsp;Firewall:\u0026nbsp;Effectively\u0026nbsp;protects\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;device\u0026nbsp;from\u0026nbsp;cyberattacks\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;intrusions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\