;tool\u0026nbsp;to\u0026nbsp;extract\u0026nbsp;data\u0026nbsp;from\u0026nbsp;social\u0026nbsp;media\u0026nbsp;websites?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYes.\u0026nbsp;Apify\u0026nbsp;provides\u0026nbsp;specialized\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eActors\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;monitoring\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;extracting\u0026nbsp;data\u0026nbsp;from\u0026nbsp;social\u0026nbsp;media\u0026nbsp;platforms,\u0026nbsp;maps,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;global\u0026nbsp;online\u0026nbsp;stores.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ:\u0026nbsp;Is\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;subscription\u0026nbsp;official,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;can\u0026nbsp;I\u0026nbsp;connect\u0026nbsp;it\u0026nbsp;to\u0026nbsp;my\u0026nbsp;own\u0026nbsp;API?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbsolutely.\u0026nbsp;The\u0026nbsp;subscription\u0026nbsp;is\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e100%\u0026nbsp;official\u003c/strong\u003e,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;you\u0026nbsp;can\u0026nbsp;use\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;own\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eAPI\u0026nbsp;Key\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;to\u0026nbsp;connect\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;results\u0026nbsp;to\u0026nbsp;any\u0026nbsp;external\u0026nbsp;marketing\u0026nbsp;or\u0026nbsp;analytics\u0026nbsp;tool.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"195:T20cd,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(118, 118, 118);\"\u003eالبيانات\u0026nbsp;هي\u0026nbsp;الذهب\u0026nbsp;الجديد..\u0026nbsp;ابدأ\u0026nbsp;باستخراجها\u0026nbsp;الآن\u0026nbsp;بأقوى\u0026nbsp;الأدوات\u0026nbsp;العالمية!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(118, 118, 118);\"\u003eهل\u0026nbsp;تبحث\u0026nbsp;عن\u0026nbsp;طريقة\u0026nbsp;احترافية\u0026nbsp;لجمع\u0026nbsp;بيانات\u0026nbsp;المنافسين،\u0026nbsp;مراقبة\u0026nbsp;الأسعار،\u0026nbsp;أو\u0026nbsp;بناء\u0026nbsp;قواعد\u0026nbsp;بيانات\u002