buy Microsoft license Microsoft tools productivity software\",\"seoTitle_ar\":\"شراء منتجات مايكروسوفت | ويندوز وأوفيس والمزيد\",\"seoTitle_en\":\"Buy Microsoft Products \u0026 Software | Windows, Office \u0026 More\"},\"productvariation\":[],\"productimage\":[],\"_count\":{\"orderitem\":0}}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1e9:T934,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e☁️\u0026nbsp;OneDrive\u0026nbsp;Subscription\u0026nbsp;—\u0026nbsp;Secure\u0026nbsp;1TB\u0026nbsp;Cloud\u0026nbsp;Storage\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGet\u0026nbsp;a\u0026nbsp;massive\u0026nbsp;1TB\u0026nbsp;(1000GB)\u0026nbsp;cloud\u0026nbsp;storage\u0026nbsp;plan\u0026nbsp;with\u0026nbsp;an\u0026nbsp;official\u0026nbsp;1-year\u0026nbsp;Microsoft\u0026nbsp;OneDrive\u0026nbsp;subscription.\u0026nbsp;OneDrive\u0026nbsp;is\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;perfect\u0026nbsp;solution\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;securely\u0026nbsp;storing\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;important\u0026nbsp;files,\u0026nbsp;photos,\u0026nbsp;videos,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;documents\u0026nbsp;while\u0026nbsp;keeping\u0026nbsp;them\u0026nbsp;synced\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;accessible\u0026nbsp;across\u0026nbsp;all\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;devices\u0026nbsp;anytime,\u0026nbsp;anywhere.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✨\u0026nbsp;Why\u0026nbsp;Choose\u0026nbsp;OneDrive?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅\u0026nbsp;Huge\u0026nbsp;Storage\u0026nbsp;Capacity\u0026nbsp;—\u0026nbsp;Enjoy\u0026nbsp;1TB\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;cloud\u0026nbsp;space\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;thousands\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;files\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;documents\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅\u0026nbsp;Seamless\u0026nbsp;Sync\u0026nbsp;Across\u0026nbsp;Devices\u0026nbsp;—\u0026nbsp;Access\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;sync\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;files\u0026nbsp;automatically\u0026nbsp;on\u0026nbsp;PC,\u0026nbsp;smartphone,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;tablet\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅\u0026nbsp;Advanced\u0026nbsp;Security\u0026nbsp;Protection\u0026nbsp;—\u0026nbsp;Strong\u0026nbsp;encryption,\u0026nbsp;password\u0026nbsp;protection,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;optional\u0026nbsp;two-step\u0026nbsp;verification\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅\u0026nbsp;Automatic\u0026nbsp;Backup\u0026nbsp;—\u0026nbsp;Keep\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;important\u0026nbsp;folders\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;files\u0026nbsp;safely\u0026nbsp;backed\u0026nbsp;up\u0026nbsp;at\u0026nbsp;all\u0026nbsp;times\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅\u0026nbsp;Multi-Language\u0026nbsp;Support\u0026nbsp;—\u0026nbsp;Works\u0026nbsp;perfectly\u0026nbsp;in\u0026nbsp;Arabic,\u0026nbsp;English,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;many\u0026nbsp;other\u0026nbsp;languages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e📋\u0026nbsp;Subscription\u0026nbsp;Details:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🔹\u0026nbsp;Duration:\u0026nbsp;1\u0026nbsp;Year\u0026nbsp;(12\u0026nbsp;Months)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🔹\u0026nbsp;Storage\u0026nbsp;Capacity:\u0026nbsp;1TB\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🔹\u0026nbsp;Activation:\u0026nbsp;Available\u0026nbsp;on\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;personal\u0026nbsp;account\u0026nbsp;or\u0026nbsp;via\u0026nbsp;a\u0026nbsp;ready-to-use\u0026nbsp;account\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e🔹\u0026nbsp;Delivery:\u0026nbsp;Activation\u0026nbsp;details\u0026nbsp;sent\u0026nbsp;via\u0026nbsp;email\u0026nbsp;within\u0026nbsp;30\u0026nbsp;minutes\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e⚡\u0026nbsp;How\u0026nbsp;to\u0026nbsp;Use:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1️⃣\u0026nbsp;Visit:\u0026nbsp;onedrive.live.com\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e2️⃣\u0026nbsp;Log\u0026nbsp;in\u0026nbsp;using\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;account\u0026nbsp;details\u0026nbsp;provided\u0026nbsp;or\u0026nbsp;activate\u0026nbsp;it\u0026nbsp;on\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;current\u0026nbsp;Microsoft\u0026nbsp;account\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3️⃣\u0026nbsp;Start\u0026nbsp;uploading,\u0026nbsp;organizing,\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;accessing\u0026nbsp;your\u0026nbsp;files\u0026nbsp;with\u0026nbsp;ease\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__ne